' Inheritance / serialization
TourTrongNuoc --|> Tour
TourNuocNgoai --|> Tour
Tour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
NhanVien ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
HanhKhach ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
KeHoachTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
ChiTietKeHoachTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
PhuongTien ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
KhachSan ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
DonDatTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
Ve ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt
HoaDon ..|> CoTheNhapXuatTxt

' Core relationships
Tour "1" -- "0..*" KeHoachTour : mo dot khoi hanh
NhanVien "1" -- "0..*" KeHoachTour : phu trach
KeHoachTour "1" *-- "0..*" ChiTietKeHoachTour : quan ly truc tiep
PhuongTien "1" -- "0..*" ChiTietKeHoachTour : duoc su dung
KhachSan "0..1" -- "0..*" ChiTietKeHoachTour : luu tru
HanhKhach "1" -- "0..*" DonDatTour : nguoi dat
KeHoachTour "1" -- "0..*" DonDatTour : duoc dat
DonDatTour "1" -- "1..*" Ve : gom ve
HanhKhach "1" -- "0..*" Ve : hanh khach
KeHoachTour "1" -- "0..*" Ve : thuoc ke hoach
DonDatTour "1" -- "0..1" HoaDon : duoc lap hoa don
NhanVien "1" -- "0..*" HoaDon : lap

' Cac lop danh sach quan ly cac doi tuong tuong ung
DanhSachTour "1" o-- "0..*" Tour : quan ly
DanhSachNhanVien "1" o-- "0..*" NhanVien : quan ly
DanhSachHanhKhach "1" o-- "0..*" HanhKhach : quan ly
DanhSachKeHoachTour "1" o-- "0..*" KeHoachTour : quan ly
DanhSachPhuongTien "1" o-- "0..*" PhuongTien : quan ly
DanhSachKhachSan "1" o-- "0..*" KhachSan : quan ly
DanhSachVe "1" o-- "0..*" Ve : quan ly
DanhSachHoaDon "1" o-- "0..*" HoaDon : quan ly
DanhSachDonDatTour "1" o-- "0..*" DonDatTour : quan ly

DanhSachTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachNhanVien ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachHanhKhach ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachKeHoachTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachPhuongTien ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachKhachSan ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachVe ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachHoaDon ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
DanhSachDonDatTour ..|> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach

NhapXuatFile ..> FileTxt : doc ghi mot file TXT
NhapXuatFile ..> CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach : nhap xuat nhieu loai du lieu
CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach ..> CoTheNhapXuatTxt : chuyen doi tung doi tuong
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachVe
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachDonDatTour
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachHoaDon
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachKeHoachTour
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachPhuongTien
BaoCaoThongKe ..> DanhSachKhachSan

note bottom of CoTheNhapXuatTxt
  Moi doi tuong du lieu chuyen thanh mot dong TXT va doc lai tu mot dong.
  Cac truong phan cach bang '|'; gia tri chua ky tu '|' phai duoc escape.
  Cac truong ngay thang dung String theo dinh dang yyyy-MM-dd.
end note

note bottom of CoTheNhapXuatDanhSach
  Moi lop danh sach chi xu ly cac loai ban ghi do layLoaiDuLieu() khai bao.
  chuanBiNhap doc va kiem tra du lieu vao mang tam, khong sua du lieu hien tai.
  Chi khi tat ca danh sach chuan bi thanh cong, NhapXuatFile moi goi xacNhanNhap().
  Neu bat ky danh sach nao that bai, goi huyNhapTam() cho tat ca danh sach.
  layTatCa() va layDanhSachChiTiet() tra ve mang chi chua cac phan tu dang su dung, khong de lo mang noi bo.
  DanhSachKeHoachTour xu ly ca KEHOACH va CHITIET; chi tiet nam trong mang cua KeHoachTour.
end note

note bottom of DonDatTour
  Moi don dat gan voi mot nguoi dat va mot ke hoach tour, co tu mot ve tro len.
  tongTien la tong gia ve duoc chot tai thoi diem dat; khong tu dong thay doi khi gia tour thay doi.
  Tong tien chi duoc xac dinh khi tao don; khong cho phep sua sau khi don da duoc tao.
  Huy don bang cach cap nhat trangThai, khong xoa vat ly de giu lich su.
  Chi huy don khi chua co HoaDon va tat ca ve thuoc don con o trang thai DA_DAT.
  Neu da lap hoa don, khong huy don truc tiep; can quy trinh dieu chinh/hoan tien rieng.
end note

note bottom of Ve
  trangThai chi nhan DA_DAT, DA_THANH_TOAN, DA_HUY.
  Ve DA_DAT va DA_THANH_TOAN chiem cho; ve DA_HUY khong chiem cho.
  maDonDatTour phai khop voi don; maKeHoachTour phai khop voi ke hoach cua don.
  Khong sua donGia cua ve da tao; donGia la gia tai thoi diem dat.
end note

note bottom of HoaDon
  Moi hoa don gan toi da mot don dat; moi don dat co toi da mot hoa don.
  tongTien duoc sao chep tu DonDatTour luc lap hoa don.
  ghiNhanThanhToan tu choi so tien <= 0 hoac vuot so tien con lai.
  Don dat da co hoa don khong duoc huy truc tiep, ke ca hoa don chua thu tien; phai co quy trinh huy/dieu chinh hoa don rieng.
  Ve chi chuyen sang DA_THANH_TOAN khi hoa don da thanh toan du.
end note

note bottom of KeHoachTour
  KeHoachTour tu quan ly ChiTietKeHoachTour[]; khong can lop danh sach trung gian cho chi tiet.
  Moi ngay chi co toi da mot chi tiet trong cung ke hoach.
  Kiem tra noi tai cua KeHoachTour bao gom khoang ngay, ngay trung/thieu va do dai lich trinh so voi Tour.soNgay.
  Truoc khi them/sua chi tiet, CLI phai tra cuu ma phuong tien/khach san qua danh sach, kiem tra suc chua
  phuong tien so voi soLuongVeToiDa; maKhachSan = 0 nghia la khong luu tru.
end note

note bottom of NhapXuatFile
  Chi co mot nhapFile() va mot xuatFile() dung chung cho mot file TXT.
  Moi dong co tien to loai ban ghi, vi du TOUR_TRONG_NUOC|..., KEHOACH|..., CHITIET|...,
  HANHKHACH|..., DON_DAT_TOUR|..., VE|..., HOADON|....
  nhapFile doc toan bo file, cho cac danh sach chuan bi va xac nhan theo co che hai pha.
  Gia tri tra ve: so ban ghi da nhap khi thanh cong; -1 khi that bai, ly do nam trong loiCuoiCung.
end note

note bottom of BaoCaoThongKe
  Doanh thu ve = tong donGia cua ve khong bi huy.
  Tien da thu = tong soTienDaThanhToan cua hoa don thuoc cac don dat cua ke hoach.
  Chi phi du kien = tong chi phi tung ngay theo so ve dang chiem cho va dich vu da chon.
  Neu maKhachSan = 0, tinhChiPhiNgay chi tinh di chuyen va khong tinh o/an cua khach san.
  Loi nhuan du kien = doanh thu ve - chi phi du kien; khong dong nhat voi tien mat da thu.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachVe
  demVeChiemChoTheoKeHoach chi dem ve DA_DAT va DA_THANH_TOAN; khong dem DA_HUY.
  Khong xoa vat ly ve da phat sinh; dung trang thai de huy.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachTour
  them() tu choi maTour trung; xoaTheoMa() chi duoc goi khi khong co ke hoach dang tham chieu tour.
  timTheoTuKhoa tim khong phan biet hoa thuong tren ten tour, diem khoi hanh va diem den.
end note


note bottom of DanhSachNhanVien
  Chi xoa nhan vien khi khong con duoc tham chieu boi KeHoachTour hoac HoaDon.
  Cap nhat thong tin qua doi tuong tra ve tu timTheoMa(), khong sua ma dinh danh.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachHanhKhach
  Khong xoa hanh khach da co DonDatTour hoac Ve; neu can vo hieu hoa, bo sung trangThai thay vi xoa lich su.
  Cap nhat thong tin qua capNhatThongTin() tren doi tuong tim duoc.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachKeHoachTour
  Chi xoa ke hoach khi khong co DonDatTour, Ve hoac HoaDon lien quan.
  timTheoKhoangNgayDi so sanh ngay String theo dinh dang yyyy-MM-dd.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachPhuongTien
  Chi xoa phuong tien khi khong duoc bat ky ChiTietKeHoachTour nao tham chieu.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachKhachSan
  Chi xoa khach san khi khong duoc bat ky ChiTietKeHoachTour nao tham chieu.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachHoaDon
  Khong xoa hoa don da phat sinh thanh toan; moi maDonDatTour chi duoc co mot hoa don.
end note

note bottom of DanhSachDonDatTour
  them() tu choi maDonDatTour trung; khong xoa don da phat sinh ve.
  Chi huy don neu timTheoDonDatTour() khong tim thay hoa don va tat ca ve con o DA_DAT.
  Truoc khi cap nhat, kiem tra tat ca ve hop le; sau do cap nhat cac ve thanh DA_HUY va don thanh DA_HUY.
end note


@enduml
